sort [grp asc]
└─ project (grp, s, a, lo, hi) (rows≈10 cost≈1.1K)
   └─ aggregate keys=[grp] aggs=[sum_0=sum, sum_1=sum, count_0=count, min_0=min, max_0=max] (rows≈10 cost≈840)
      └─ project (grp, q.g) (rows≈10 cost≈400)
         └─ project (q.id, q.g) (rows≈10 cost≈320)
            └─ filter (> |t.id| 1) (rows≈10 cost≈240)
               └─ source t AS t row-groups (> |t.id| 1) (rows≈10 cost≈120)
